SolarRide — licensing notice

English
=======

Copyright (c) 2026 Andy-Hyy, except third-party material credited separately.
This repository uses different licenses for different kinds of files.

1. Original software in firmware/, tools/, tests/ (*.cpp), and .github/:
   MIT — see LICENSES/MIT.txt.
2. Original circuit and enclosure designs in hardware/:
   CERN-OHL-P-2.0 — see LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt.
3. Documentation, original diagrams, metadata, and test data (including
   README files, docs/, tests/fixtures/, and root prose documents):
   CC-BY-4.0 — see LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Third-party libraries, standard license texts, component datasheets and
vendor library assets retain their own licenses. A project license does
not relicense them. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/en/licensing.md.

The English license texts in LICENSES/ are the license terms.
The Chinese explanations are informational summaries.

中文
====

SolarRide 许可说明

除单独注明的第三方材料外，版权所有 (c) 2026 Andy-Hyy。
本仓库按文件类别使用不同许可证。

1. firmware/、tools/、tests/ 内的原创 C++ 测试程序及 .github/ 内的
   原创软件与协作配置采用 MIT，见 LICENSES/MIT.txt。
2. hardware/ 内的原创电路及外壳设计采用 CERN-OHL-P-2.0，
   见 LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt。
3. 文档、原创示意图、元数据与测试数据，包括 README 文件、docs/、
   tests/fixtures/ 和根目录说明文档，采用 CC-BY-4.0，
   见 LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt。

第三方库、标准许可证文本、器件资料和厂商库资源保留各自许可，
项目许可不改变其条款。详情见 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 和
docs/zh-CN/licensing.md。

LICENSES/ 内的英文许可证原文为许可条款，中文说明仅用于解释。
